            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146670,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Os jogos repetem as mesmas linhas de código várias vezes para atualizar o que você vê, como os inimigos repetidos na tela do jogo abaixo.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA;  &lt;head&gt;&#xA;    &lt;title&gt;Arcade&lt;/title&gt;&#xA;    &lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css&quot; /&gt;&#xA;    &lt;style&gt;&#xA;      body {&#xA;        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;        background: #0b1020;&#xA;        display: flex;&#xA;        flex-direction: column;&#xA;        align-items: center;&#xA;        margin: 0;&#xA;        color: #e8eefc;&#xA;      }&#xA;&#xA;      h1 {&#xA;        background-color: #3b82f6;&#xA;        color: white;&#xA;        padding: 20px;&#xA;        border-radius: 10px;&#xA;        box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);&#xA;      }&#xA;&#xA;      .icon-list {&#xA;        background: #111a33;&#xA;        list-style-type: none;&#xA;        padding: 20px;&#xA;        border-radius: 10px;&#xA;        box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);&#xA;        width: 340px;&#xA;      }&#xA;&#xA;      .icon-list li {&#xA;        display: flex;&#xA;        align-items: center;&#xA;        margin: 10px 0;&#xA;        font-size: 20px;&#xA;        font-weight: bold;&#xA;        background-color: #0f244a;&#xA;        padding: 10px;&#xA;        border-radius: 5px;&#xA;        transition: background-color 0.3s;&#xA;      }&#xA;&#xA;      .icon-list li:hover {&#xA;        background-color: #153063;&#xA;      }&#xA;&#xA;      .icon-list li i {&#xA;        margin-right: 15px;&#xA;        color: #60a5fa;&#xA;        font-size: 28px;&#xA;      }&#xA;    &lt;/style&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;body&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h1&gt;Enemies&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;    &lt;ul class=&quot;icon-list&quot;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fas fa-ghost&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Ghost&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fas fa-skull&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Skeleton&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fas fa-spider&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Spider&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;      &lt;li&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fas fa-dragon&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt; Dragon&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;    &lt;script src=&quot;script.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146671,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uma maneira de repetir linhas de código é escrevê-las repetidamente, mas isso leva muito tempo se quisermos criar jogos maiores.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"128\" endIndex=\"129\" /><option startIndex=\"129\" endIndex=\"141\" /><option startIndex=\"141\" endIndex=\"142\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>\"</code> seguido de <code>Frame update</code> e finalmente <code>\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146672,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para construir jogos maiores, repetimos linhas de código usando um <strong>while loop</strong>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>while</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146673,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usar um loop while para repetir linhas de código começa com a palavra-chave while.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>while</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146674,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um loop while repete seu bloco de código enquanto sua condição for <code>true</code>. Nós codificamos uma condição <code>true</code> com <code>(true)</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>(</code> seguido de <code>true</code> e finalmente <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146675,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O código que um laço while repete vai dentro de chaves <code>{ }</code>. Chamamos isso de bloco de código do laço while.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>{</code> seguido de <code>console.log(\"Frame update\");</code> e finalmente <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146676,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se a condição de um loop while permanecer <code>true</code> para sempre, chamamos isso de <strong>loop infinito</strong> já que ele irá executar infinitamente.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"11\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 146677,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como não podemos mostrar mensagens infinitas de <code>Frame update</code> no seu console, o código trava o seu jogo.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame update&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
